I don't like locked shop doors.  I lost two games in a row by this.
If this won't be changed, it is very dangerous to examine rooms with
locked doors that are not in the middle of a level.

Eating food is also too dangerous.  I lost a level 10 character
because I ate something next to a dead troll.  I had about 80 hit
points at that time.  I don't care too much what happened to the food,
if a monster interrupts.  If one prays often enough, almost no food is
needed anyway.

Andreas


